 d Fitch\, respectively\, placing it firmly in investment grade territory. 
 The offering is expected to close prior to Corteva's separation of its See
 d and Crop Protection businesses\, with any notes representing an investme
 nt in the Crop Protection Business of New Corteva\, with recourse solely a
 gainst EIDP's assets.
